        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprise SCP, Modern Brooklyn Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOver the years we have seen the popularity of square designs grow in home decor and we don't think that it only has to do with minimal design. With its clean lines, a square pull can take on so much personality. Choose an oil rubbed bronze finish for a show-stopping, bold statement; or pair with a polished brass finish for a modern pull with a vintage feel. We love the Brooklyn Square Cabinet Pull because it has its finger on the pulse of modern design: sharp, bold, and always beautiful. Available in 3 sizes: 3-1/2 inch, 4 inch, and 6 inch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Square Brooklyn Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Includes all mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>SCP-350:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>SCP-400:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>SCP-600:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
